# Real trace — H3 IO multi-caliber one-seat family (IOFAM-SELF CAL-1 件②, EVAL-DONGHU-A §29.42.5)
#
# Golden sample donghu.ftrace, window 13762.791708..13763.024898.
#
# HARD oracle (trace-recomputable measurement semantics, revised 2026-08-17):
#   · target request issue→complete residence reaches 1.347ms. This is one
#     request's elapsed wall clock, not target blocking time.
#   · the strict completion→issuer-wakeup closure for that request measures
#     1.337ms of target blocking wall clock, even though its scheduler state is
#     interruptible S rather than D/iowait.
#   · the global exact-pair display is capacity-truncated (8/198; 190 hidden,
#     41.329 request·ms). request·ms may overlap and is non-wall-clock /
#     non-additive; global emitted/total is not a target request count.
#   · pid 17267 has zero scheduler D/io-wait occurrences in this window. That
#     does not refute the separately proven S-state completion-closed waits.
#
# ORACLE EVOLUTION: the former hard strings `完成端到端·IO延迟（io_latency）`,
# `块设备IO(inode)` and `综合评分,非墙钟` came from a deterministic system
# projection that composed one fixed answer seat. Finite runtime fact queries
# no longer authorize that system-written conclusion surface: the system hands
# exact typed measurements to the finalizer and the model owns wording and
# conclusion. Requiring those display strings both overfit one answer layout
# and forced unrelated window-context pressure/inode rows into a target-self
# question. The current oracle pins the physical rulers and scope instead.
#
# SOFT/human audit:
#   · do not call global 8/198 coverage the target's request count;
#   · background storage/inode/pressure rows, if mentioned, stay explicit
#     selected-window context and never become the target's wait/root cause;
#   · no request residence, issuer-blocked interval, or request·ms sum is added
#     across incompatible/overlapping rulers.
ID="real_trace_h3_iofam_one_seat"
NAME="real trace donghu — IO multi-caliber one-seat"
QUESTION="只分析这份 trace，不分析代码。请分析 .ugc.aweme.lite-17267 在 13762.791708s 到 13763.024898s 窗口内自身的 IO 等待与 IO 延迟：不同统计口径下的 IO 指标分别是多少？哪些口径是墙钟时间，哪些不是？"
